// Typecheck facade for both client halves.
//
// `src/client/dag/` is the upstream @nanmicoder/dsh-agent-teams 0.1.21 client,
// ported verbatim (see docs/development-plan.md §D1). Upstream's own
// tsconfig.client.json does not enable `exactOptionalPropertyTypes`, while this
// repository's Harness-derived facade does; under the extra flag several ported
// call sites stop compiling (TS2375/TS2379) purely because upstream writes
// `{ footer: maybeUndefined }` where the facade wants the key omitted. The flag
// is relaxed for this package so the ported subtree stays byte-identical and
// stays cheap to diff against the next upstream release.
//
// Relaxing it is type-check only: the emitted bundle and the published .d.ts are
// unaffected, and the base Team half was already clean under the stricter
// setting, so nothing regresses today — it only means the setting no longer
// guards future edits in this package.
{
  "extends": "../../tsconfig.types.json",
  "include": ["src", "tests"],
  "compilerOptions": {
    "jsx": "react-jsx",
    "exactOptionalPropertyTypes": false
  }
}
